XPAM facelive
=============

This component recognises faces with two models from the OpenCV model zoo
(https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo). Both licences allow commercial use.
No InsightFace model (non-commercial licence) is used or shipped.

1. Face detection: YuNet  (face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx)
   Licence: MIT.  Copyright (c) 2020 Shiqi Yu.
   Source: https://github.com/ShiqiYu/libfacedetection.train
   Zoo page and licence text: opencv_zoo/models/face_detection_yunet/LICENSE
   SHA-256: 8f2383e4dd3cfbb4553ea8718107fc0423210dc964f9f4280604804ed2552fa4

2. Face recognition: SFace  (face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx)
   Licence: Apache License 2.0.  Model by Yaoyao Zhong et al. (SFace: Sigmoid-constrained
   hypersphere loss for robust face recognition, https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.12010),
   ONNX conversion by Chengrui Wang.
   Source: https://github.com/zhongyy/SFace
   Zoo page and licence text: opencv_zoo/models/face_recognition_sface/LICENSE
   SHA-256: 0ba9fbfa01b5270c96627c4ef784da859931e02f04419c829e83484087c34e79
   Note: the licence covers the model file. The data the model was trained on is not part of
   the licence; check with your own counsel if that matters for your use.

The model files are downloaded when the image is built and checked against the SHA-256 above
(tools/fetch_models.py); the engine checks them again every time it starts.

Python libraries (see requirements.txt): opencv-python-headless (Apache-2.0 for OpenCV; the wheel
also bundles FFmpeg under LGPL-2.1 and other libraries, see the licence files inside the wheel),
numpy (BSD-3-Clause), websockets (BSD-3-Clause).

Test images (tests/data, used only by the unit tests, not shipped in the image): see tests/data/SOURCES.md.
